    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a really poetic way to put it, but it doesn't change the math. The math says I spent my entire adult life building something that doesn't exist anymore. I feel like I've been playing a game where the rules kept changing and the goalposts kept moving, and now I'm just sitting here with nothing to show for it. It's like I invested everything into a losing hand. Why keep playing when you know the game is rigged and you've already lost everything?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
